Images
======

Owl icons and application logo
------------------------------
  Files:   flutter/assets/icons/*  (including colman_logo.jpeg; also used
           by the desktop application via colman_owls.qrc)
           application icons derived from the logo in flutter/android,
           flutter/ios, flutter/macos, flutter/web and flutter/windows
  Origin:  AI-generated (text-to-image) for this project with Bing Image
           Creator (https://www.bing.com/images/create/ai-image-generator).
  License: To the extent that copyright subsists in these images, they are
           distributed under the same terms as colman
           (GPL-3.0-or-later).

"Powered by BGG" logo
---------------------
  Files:   flutter/assets/thirdparty/powered-by-bgg-rgb.svg
  Owner:   BoardGameGeek, LLC.  The logo is a trademark of BoardGameGeek
           and is NOT covered by colman's license.
  Usage:   Displayed as attribution required by the BoardGameGeek XML API
           terms of use when board game data from BoardGameGeek is shown.

Tutorial screenshots
--------------------
  Files:   doc/tutorial/*/screenshots/*
  Origin:  Generated automatically from colman (tools/tutorial_screenshots.sh)
           using the fictitious sample data in doc/tutorial/*/sample_data.json.
           All persons, schools and e-mail addresses in the sample data are
           invented.


