External services
=================

colman can optionally query the following online services to look up item
metadata and cover images.  No data from these services is included in this
repository.  Their use is subject to the respective terms of service;
operators of a colman installation are responsible for complying with them.

  Open Library / Open Library Covers      https://openlibrary.org
  Deutsche Nationalbibliothek (SRU)        https://services.dnb.de
  Library of Congress (SRU)                https://www.loc.gov
  Further SRU library catalogues           see doc/sru_servers.md
  Google Books API                         https://www.googleapis.com
  MusicBrainz / Cover Art Archive          https://musicbrainz.org
  BoardGameGeek XML API (token required)   https://boardgamegeek.com
  Open EAN/GTIN Database (user ID req.)    https://opengtindb.org
  Amazon (cover image selection in an
          embedded browser, user-driven)   https://www.amazon.de

Cover images and metadata obtained from these services may be protected by
copyright held by their respective owners.
